  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Electric Express Train Phase-1 Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is the phase 1 of an Electrical Express Train (EET) program that includes three lines (Green, Blue and Red lines) of a total length of 1,985 kilometer. The objective of the EET Phase-1 project (Green Line) is to contribute to the overall socio-economic development of Egypt in providing access to safe, affordable, accessible, and sustainable transport system for all. This will be achieved through the development of 660 km sustainable, green, and climate resilient electric express railway system.</narrative>
  </description>
